# Requires FORWARD_URL set in .env (e.g. FORWARD_URL=http://localhost:3000).
# Kapture forwards the request unchanged and keeps the correlationId.

### Capture + forward a webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/kapture/forwarded/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Kapture-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "order": 123,
  "total": 99.9
}

### Verify the forwarded capture kept its correlation id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/captures?correlationId={{correlationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
